    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "I like juice",
      "content": "I like juice. 我喜欢果汁。想要一杯，说：Juice, please. 或 May I have some juice?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "some 的用法",
      "content": "液体、不可数的东西前用 some：some water, some milk。不说 a water。"
    }
  ],
  "exercises": [
    {
      "id": "yy-1b-u1-l03-ex1",
      "type": "listen",
      "stem": "听一听，选出你听到的句子。",
